      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sweet_Briar_College"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The name \"Sweet Briar\" came from the roses that grew on the former plantation, originally called Locust Ridge.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
