      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sweet_Briar_College"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1964, Sweet Briar removed \"white\" from its charter to comply with the Civil Rights Act, filing a complaint with the county court.",
